{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01CMUNVbZiBjoC2mtaRvcaN8","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: KL优势是假象。BCE的核心瓶颈不是loss function而是缺少compensation mechanism。 加上FastForward风格的compensation\n2\t  MLP后，BCE+comp在PPL和downstream tasks上追平甚至反超KL-only。 KL-only训练不稳定（5-seed std > 0.8，2个新seed\n3\t  PPL > 10.5），稳定性劣于BCE+comp。 s²scaling理论不成立（R² < 0.7），linear fit同样好。SPON+KL非可加，Mistral结果方向反转。\n4\t  Paper重心从\"KL eliminates compensation\"转向\"首个系统性taxonomy of training signals × correction\n5\t  granularity for activation sparsity\"，以characterization study投EMNLP Efficient Methods\n6\t  track。\n7\timagined_experiments:\n8\t- name: Four-condition ablation @ 50% sparsity\n9\t  plan_id: plan_001\n10\t  description: 四条件消融：(a) BCE-only 3 seeds existing, (b) BCE+comp 5 seeds new, (c)\n11\t    KL-only 5 seeds (3 existing + 2 new), (d) KL+comp 3 seeds new。 Headline对比KL-only\n12\t    vs BCE+comp各5 seeds。\n13\t  expected_results:\n14\t    kl_only_s42_ppl: 9.21\n15\t    kl_only_s123_ppl: 9.25\n16\t    kl_only_s456_ppl: 9.14\n17\t    kl_only_s0_ppl: 10.31\n18\t    kl_only_s1_ppl: 11.08\n19\t    kl_only_mean_ppl: 9.8\n20\t    kl_only_std_ppl: 0.87\n21\t    kl_only_model_sparsity: 0.498\n22\t    bce_comp_s42_ppl: 9.18\n23\t    bce_comp_s123_ppl: 9.35\n24\t    bce_comp_s456_ppl: 9.52\n25\t    bce_comp_s0_ppl: 9.28\n26\t    bce_comp_s1_ppl: 9.68\n27\t    bce_comp_mean_ppl: 9.4\n28\t    bce_comp_std_ppl: 0.19\n29\t    bce_comp_model_sparsity: 0.496\n30\t    kl_comp_s42_ppl: 8.82\n31\t    kl_comp_s123_ppl: 8.95\n32\t    kl_comp_s456_ppl: 9.08\n33\t    kl_comp_mean_ppl: 8.95\n34\t    kl_comp_std_ppl: 0.13\n35\t    bce_only_mean_ppl: 28.16\n36\t    kl_vs_bce_comp_gap: 0.4\n37\t    kl_comp_vs_bce_comp_gap: -0.45\n38\t    dense_ppl: 6.12\n39\t  result_rationale: s0和s1两个新seed暴露了KL训练的Lagrangian不稳定性。 Lagrangian乘子在这两个seed下出现λ震荡（未收敛到稳定平衡点），\n40\t    导致sparsity在0.47-0.52间振荡，predictor未充分优化。 s456的teal异常（13.58 vs 12.08/11.91）已经暗示了seed敏感性，\n41\t    新seed进一步确认：KL+Lagrangian在某些初始化下不稳定， std=0.87远高于BCE+comp的0.19。 BCE+comp通过compensation\n42\t    MLP有效纠正了BCE predictor的per-neuron误差， 从28.16降至9.40——compensation消除了~67%的BCE quality\n43\t    gap。 KL+comp是最佳条件（8.95），说明compensation对KL也有帮助， 而非KL已经\"不需要\"compensation。核心发现：compensation是通用质量提升手段，\n44\t    KL的\"优势\"仅是在不公平对比（有comp vs 无comp）下的假象。\n45\t  tables:\n46\t  - title: 'Table 1: Four-condition WikiText-2 PPL @ 50% sparsity (Llama 3.1 8B)'\n47\t    rows:\n48\t    - Condition | Seeds | Mean PPL | Std | Δ vs Dense (%)\n49\t    - Dense (no sparsity) | — | 6.12 | — | —\n50\t    - BCE-only | 3 | 28.16 | 0.22 | +360.1%\n51\t    - BCE+compensation | 5 | 9.40 | 0.19 | +53.6%\n52\t    - KL-only | 5 | 9.80 | 0.87 | +60.1%\n53\t    - KL+compensation | 3 | 8.95 | 0.13 | +46.2%\n54\t  - title: 'Table 1b: Per-seed breakdown'\n55\t    rows:\n56\t    - Seed | BCE-only | BCE+comp | KL-only | KL+comp\n57\t    - s42  | 27.96    | 9.18     | 9.21    | 8.82\n58\t    - s123 | 28.38    | 9.35     | 9.25    | 8.95\n59\t    - s456 | 28.14    | 9.52     | 9.14    | 9.08\n60\t    - s0   | —        | 9.28     | 10.31   | —\n61\t    - s1   | —        | 9.68     | 11.08   | —\n62\t  figures_description:\n63\t  - 'Fig 1a: Boxplot of WikiText-2 PPL across 4 conditions. KL-only box明显比BCE+comp宽（whisker覆盖9.14-11.08），且median偏高。BCE+comp\n64\t    box最窄最低。KL+comp最低但仅3 seeds。'\n65\t  - 'Fig 1b: Per-seed PPL scatter plot with mean±std error bars。突出s0/s1两个KL outlier。'\n66\t  - 'Fig 1c: Training loss curves (KL loss for KL conditions, BCE loss for BCE conditions)。KL\n67\t    s0和s1的loss曲线后半段出现oscillation，lambda未收敛。'\n68\t  analysis: 'headline claim \"KL eliminates compensation\"不成立。BCE+comp (9.40) < KL-only\n69\t    (9.80)， 且KL-only的高方差使其在deployment中不可靠。 KL+comp是全局最佳（8.95），但这反证了compensation的通用价值，\n70\t    而非KL的独特优势。Narrative需从\"KL beats BCE+comp\"转向 \"characterization: 不同training signal\n71\t    × compensation的交互效应\"。 唯一保留的KL叙事：KL-only在不使用compensation时确实优于BCE-only（9.80 vs 28.16），\n72\t    但这个\"免compensation\"优势在BCE+comp面前消失。'\n73\t- name: STE baseline (KL + Straight-Through Estimator)\n74\t  plan_id: plan_002\n75\t  description: 用STE替换Gumbel-sigmoid作为梯度通路，保留KL loss不变。 隔离KL优势来源：loss function还是relaxation\n76\t    method。3 seeds。\n77\t  expected_results:\n78\t    ste_kl_s42_ppl: 9.85\n79\t    ste_kl_s123_ppl: 10.1\n80\t    ste_kl_s456_ppl: 9.72\n81\t    ste_kl_mean_ppl: 9.89\n82\t    ste_kl_std_ppl: 0.19\n83\t    ste_kl_model_sparsity: 0.497\n84\t    ste_kl_vs_gumbel_kl_gap: 0.09\n85\t    ste_kl_training_steps_to_converge: 950\n86\t  result_rationale: STE+KL (9.89) ≈ Gumbel+KL (9.80)，差距仅0.09 PPL，在KL-only自身方差（std=0.87）\n87\t    内可忽略。这说明Gumbel-sigmoid relaxation对最终质量贡献极小， KL loss gradient本身才是驱动因素。 表面上这支持\"KL是关键\"——但结合plan_001的结论（BCE+comp追平KL），\n88\t    更准确的解读是：任何能传递端到端output-distribution信息的training signal （无论STE还是Gumbel路径）都能达到~9.8\n89\t    PPL，而BCE+comp通过不同路径达到了9.4。 relaxation method不重要这一事实削弱了论文的technical novelty—— \"Gumbel\n90\t    + KL\"不是一个不可替代的组合，STE+KL同样有效。\n91\t  tables:\n92\t  - title: 'Table 2: Gradient estimator ablation (KL loss fixed)'\n93\t    rows:\n94\t    - Method | Mean PPL | Std | Sparsity\n95\t    - Gumbel-sigmoid + KL | 9.80 | 0.87 | 0.498\n96\t    - STE + KL | 9.89 | 0.19 | 0.497\n97\t    - BCE-only (ref) | 28.16 | 0.22 | 0.496\n98\t  figures_description:\n99\t  - 'Fig 2: Training curves overlay — Gumbel+KL vs STE+KL。两条KL loss曲线高度重合，STE略慢收敛（~50\n100\t    steps），最终值相同。STE的sparsity曲线更平滑（无Gumbel温度退火的阶梯）。'\n101\t  analysis: STE≈Gumbel确认relaxation method不是KL优势的来源。 但结合BCE+comp追平KL的结果，因果归因链断裂： KL的优势不来自relaxation，也不来自\"独特的loss\n102\t    function\"—— 因为compensation可以弥补BCE的不足。 论文无法claim \"our Gumbel-KL combination is\n103\t    uniquely effective\"。 可作为honest ablation报告，支持characterization study叙事。 额外发现：STE+KL的std=0.19远低于Gumbel+KL的0.87，\n104\t    说明Gumbel温度退火引入了额外的seed sensitivity（进一步削弱Gumbel的必要性）。\n105\t- name: Iso-compute BCE vs KL\n106\t  plan_id: plan_003\n107\t  description: KL每步需full forward pass计算output logits（~2x FLOPs per step vs BCE用cached\n108\t    targets）。 给BCE等量total FLOPs（extended training），评估compute-normalized比较。3 seeds。\n109\t  expected_results:\n110\t    kl_flops_per_step: 4.2e14\n111\t    bce_flops_per_step: 1.8e14\n112\t    kl_total_training_flops: 4.2e17\n113\t    bce_extended_steps: 2333\n114\t    bce_extended_s42_ppl: 24.5\n115\t    bce_extended_s123_ppl: 25.1\n116\t    bce_extended_s456_ppl: 24.8\n117\t    bce_extended_mean_ppl: 24.8\n118\t    bce_extended_std_ppl: 0.3\n119\t    bce_1000step_mean_ppl: 28.16\n120\t    bce_improvement_from_extended: -3.36\n121\t    kl_training_time_min: 42\n122\t    bce_extended_training_time_min: 58\n123\t  result_rationale: BCE extended training从28.16降至24.80——额外1333步仅带来3.36 PPL改善。 BCE的收敛曲线在~800步后进入plateau，更多步数的边际收益递减。\n124\t    这是因为BCE的per-neuron factorized gradient本身信息不足： 无论训练多久，BCE无法学到neuron间的joint interaction。\n125\t    但这个结果不支持\"KL需要更多compute所以不公平\"的reviewer concern—— 即使给BCE等量compute，差距仍然巨大（24.80 vs\n126\t    9.80）。 然而结合plan_001，真正的解决方案不是更多BCE training， 而是加compensation（9.40）——这才是compute的正确使用方式。\n127\t  tables:\n128\t  - title: 'Table 3: Iso-compute comparison'\n129\t    rows:\n130\t    - Condition | Steps | Total FLOPs | Mean PPL | Wall Time\n131\t    - KL-only (1000 steps) | 1000 | 4.2e17 | 9.80 | 42 min\n132\t    - BCE-only (1000 steps) | 1000 | 1.8e17 | 28.16 | 25 min\n133\t    - BCE-only (extended, iso-FLOP) | 2333 | 4.2e17 | 24.80 | 58 min\n134\t    - BCE+comp (1000+500 steps) | 1500 | 3.5e17 | 9.40 | 50 min\n135\t  figures_description:\n136\t  - 'Fig 3: PPL vs total FLOPs曲线。KL在~4e17 FLOPs处达到9.80；BCE extended在同样FLOPs仅到24.80；BCE+comp在更少FLOPs（3.5e17）就到9.40。说明compute不是瓶颈，compensation\n137\t    architecture才是。'\n138\t  analysis: Iso-compute消除了\"KL wins because more compute\"的reviewer concern。 但同时也表明：BCE的瓶颈不是compute，而是loss\n139\t    function的结构性局限。 当compensation弥补了这个局限后（BCE+comp），以更少compute达到更好结果。 论文中可诚实报告：KL确实compute-efficient（fewer\n140\t    total FLOPs to reach good quality）， 但\"KL eliminates compensation\"的claim仍然不成立。\n141\t- name: SPON reimplementation & reproduction\n142\t  plan_id: plan_004\n143\t  description: 在Llama 3.1 8B上重现SPON（static learnable bias + KL training）。 5个QA benchmarks验证reproduction质量。\n144\t  expected_results:\n145\t    spon_wikitext2_ppl: 10.82\n146\t    spon_model_sparsity: 0.5\n147\t    spon_params_per_layer: 4096\n148\t    spon_total_params: 131072\n149\t    spon_training_time_min: 15\n150\t    spon_arc_c: 50.2\n151\t    spon_arc_e: 77.5\n152\t    spon_boolq: 79.8\n153\t    spon_piqa: 78.1\n154\t    spon_winogrande: 73.6\n155\t    published_arc_c: 50.8\n156\t    published_arc_e: 78.2\n157\t    published_boolq: 80.5\n158\t    published_piqa: 78.8\n159\t    published_winogrande: 74.2\n160\t    reproduction_max_gap: 1.0\n161\t  result_rationale: SPON方法简单（每层仅hidden_dim个learnable参数），超参数空间小， reproduction误差主要来自KL训练的随机性和calibration\n162\t    data差异。 所有5个benchmark与published results差距 < 1 point，reproduction合格。 PPL=10.82确认static\n163\t    correction的天花板：input-independent bias只能修正 average-case drift，无法适应per-input neuron\n164\t    importance变化。 这为plan_005的composition实验提供了valid SPON baseline。\n165\t  tables:\n166\t  - title: 'Table 4: SPON reproduction on 5 QA benchmarks'\n167\t    rows:\n168\t    - Benchmark | Published | Ours | Δ\n169\t    - ARC-c | 50.8 | 50.2 | -0.6\n170\t    - ARC-e | 78.2 | 77.5 | -0.7\n171\t    - BoolQ | 80.5 | 79.8 | -0.7\n172\t    - PIQA | 78.8 | 78.1 | -0.7\n173\t    - WinoGrande | 74.2 | 73.6 | -0.6\n174\t  figures_description: []\n175\t  analysis: SPON reproduction成功，5个benchmark最大偏差0.7 points。 PPL=10.82介于KL-only (9.80)和training-free\n176\t    (~12.5)之间， 符合static correction的预期能力范围。\n177\t- name: SPON + KL predictor composition & additivity test\n178\t  plan_id: plan_005\n179\t  description: 同时应用SPON bias correction + KL contextual prediction。 Output-space linearity测试和per-layer正交性分析。3\n180\t    seeds。\n181\t  expected_results:\n182\t    spon_kl_s42_ppl: 9.55\n183\t    spon_kl_s123_ppl: 9.78\n184\t    spon_kl_s456_ppl: 10.05\n185\t    spon_kl_mean_ppl: 9.79\n186\t    spon_kl_std_ppl: 0.25\n187\t    spon_only_ppl: 10.82\n188\t    kl_only_mean_ppl: 9.8\n189\t    teal_baseline_ppl: 12.5\n190\t    spon_improvement_over_teal: 1.68\n191\t    kl_improvement_over_teal: 2.7\n192\t    predicted_additive_ppl: 8.12\n193\t    actual_combined_ppl: 9.79\n194\t    additivity_residual_ppl: 1.67\n195\t    additivity_ratio: 0.62\n196\t    logit_residual_norm_ratio: 0.38\n197\t    mean_cos_similarity: 0.34\n198\t    layers_with_cos_gt_03: 20\n199\t    max_cos_similarity_layer: 0.62\n200\t  result_rationale: SPON+KL (9.79) ≈ KL-only (9.80)——组合几乎没有额外收益。 predicted additive\n201\t    PPL=8.12 vs actual=9.79，additivity ratio仅0.62。 原因：SPON的static bias和KL predictor的contextual\n202\t    correction在output space 高度相关——两者都在修正同一组\"容易误杀\"的neurons的drift。 cos similarity分析确认：在中间层（layer\n203\t    12-20），两种correction方向高度一致 （cos > 0.4），说明它们修正的是同一类误差而非互补的不同误差源。 Claim 2（可加性）在worst\n204\t    tier下彻底不成立。 logit_residual_norm_ratio=0.38 >> 0（如果可加应接近0）， interaction term不可忽略。\n205\t  tables:\n206\t  - title: 'Table 5: SPON + KL composition results'\n207\t    rows:\n208\t    - Condition | PPL | Improvement over TEAL\n209\t    - TEAL baseline | 12.50 | —\n210\t    - SPON only | 10.82 | 1.68\n211\t    - KL only | 9.80 | 2.70\n212\t    - SPON+KL (actual) | 9.79 | 2.71\n213\t    - SPON+KL (additive prediction) | 8.12 | 4.38\n214\t  - title: 'Table 5b: Additivity metrics'\n215\t    rows:\n216\t    - Metric | Value\n217\t    - Additivity ratio | 0.62\n218\t    - Logit residual norm ratio | 0.38\n219\t    - Mean cos(c_s, c_θ) | 0.34\n220\t    - Layers with cos > 0.3 | 20/32\n221\t  figures_description:\n222\t  - 'Fig 5a: Per-layer cos similarity heatmap (32 layers × 3 seeds)。中间层（12-20）呈暖色（cos\n223\t    > 0.4），首尾层冷色（cos < 0.2）。说明interaction集中在中间表征层。'\n224\t  - 'Fig 5b: Logit residual magnitude per layer bar chart。中间层residual最大，与cos similarity\n225\t    pattern一致。'\n226\t  analysis: SPON+KL composition不满足可加性假设（Claim 2不成立）。 但这本身是一个有价值的empirical finding——\n227\t    \"static和contextual corrections的overlap分析\"可作为standalone贡献。 论文中不再claim可加性，改为report\n228\t    interaction structure： \"static和contextual corrections在中间层高度相关， suggesting both\n229\t    target the same error mode (average-case neuron importance drift)\"。 这支持characterization\n230\t    study的叙事方向。\n231\t- name: Training-free baselines @ 50% sparsity\n232\t  plan_id: plan_006\n233\t  description: TEAL (activation magnitude + greedy allocation), WINA (weight-informed\n234\t    scoring), R-Sparse (rank-aware scoring)。建立三层比较：training-free < static-learned\n235\t    < contextual-learned。\n236\t  expected_results:\n237\t    teal_vanilla_ppl: 12.48\n238\t    wina_ppl: 15.8\n239\t    rsparse_ppl: 14.2\n240\t    dense_ppl: 6.12\n241\t    teal_vanilla_sparsity: 0.5\n242\t    wina_sparsity: 0.5\n243\t    rsparse_sparsity: 0.5\n244\t    teal_vs_dense_pct: 103.9\n245\t    wina_vs_dense_pct: 158.2\n246\t    rsparse_vs_dense_pct: 132.0\n247\t  result_rationale: TEAL表现最好（12.48），因为activation magnitude是neuron importance的直接proxy，\n248\t    加上greedy per-layer allocation自适应地保护关键层。 R-Sparse (14.20)次之——rank-aware scoring考虑了相对重要性但无跨层allocation。\n249\t    WINA最差（15.80）——weight-informed scoring在SwiGLU gate×up结构下信号较弱， weight magnitude与activation\n250\t    importance的相关性不如直接用activation。 这建立了清晰的tier结构：training-free（12-16）<< SPON（10.8）<<\n251\t    contextual（9.4-9.8）。 注意这里的TEAL使用vanilla activation magnitude（非predictor scores），\n252\t    与registry中基于predictor scores的\"teal_sparse_ppl\"不同。\n253\t  tables:\n254\t  - title: 'Table 6: Training-free baselines @ 50% sparsity'\n255\t    rows:\n256\t    - Method | WikiText-2 PPL | Δ vs Dense (%)\n257\t    - Dense | 6.12 | —\n258\t    - TEAL (activation magnitude) | 12.48 | +103.9%\n259\t    - R-Sparse | 14.20 | +132.0%\n260\t    - WINA | 15.80 | +158.2%\n261\t    - SPON (static learned) | 10.82 | +76.8%\n262\t    - KL-only (contextual) | 9.80 | +60.1%\n263\t    - BCE+comp (contextual) | 9.40 | +53.6%\n264\t  figures_description:\n265\t  - 'Fig 6: PPL bar chart (horizontal) 按质量排序。清晰展示training-free → static → contextual的层级。BCE+comp和KL-only在误差bar内重叠。'\n266\t  analysis: 三层层级结构清晰，training-free到contextual有6-7 PPL points的gap。 这验证了learned prediction的价值。在worst\n267\t    tier下， KL-only和BCE+comp处于同一tier（contextual），彼此差距不显著。 paper的taxonomy贡献成立：不同training\n268\t    signal在不同granularity下的表现分布 本身就是有价值的empirical map。\n269\t- name: Full benchmark suite + wall-clock profiling\n270\t  plan_id: plan_007\n271\t  description: 所有条件在Llama 3.1 8B上的完整评估：WikiText-2, C4, ARC-c, WinoGrande, MMLU, GSM8K,\n272\t    HumanEval。Wall-clock profiling和Pareto frontier。\n273\t  expected_results:\n274\t    dense_wikitext2: 6.12\n275\t    dense_c4: 8.85\n276\t    dense_arc_c: 53.2\n277\t    dense_winogrande: 76.4\n278\t    dense_mmlu: 65.8\n279\t    dense_gsm8k: 52.1\n280\t    dense_humaneval: 31.7\n281\t    kl_wikitext2: 9.8\n282\t    kl_c4: 12.65\n283\t    kl_arc_c: 48.2\n284\t    kl_winogrande: 69.8\n285\t    kl_mmlu: 60.1\n286\t    kl_gsm8k: 44.5\n287\t    kl_humaneval: 25.0\n288\t    kl_mean_acc_drop_vs_dense_pct: 8.9\n289\t    bce_comp_wikitext2: 9.4\n290\t    bce_comp_c4: 12.15\n291\t    bce_comp_arc_c: 49.5\n292\t    bce_comp_winogrande: 71.2\n293\t    bce_comp_mmlu: 61.5\n294\t    bce_comp_gsm8k: 46.0\n295\t    bce_comp_humaneval: 26.5\n296\t    bce_comp_mean_acc_drop_vs_dense_pct: 7.4\n297\t    spon_wikitext2: 10.82\n298\t    spon_c4: 14.0\n299\t    spon_arc_c: 46.5\n300\t    spon_winogrande: 67.0\n301\t    spon_mmlu: 57.8\n302\t    spon_gsm8k: 40.2\n303\t    spon_humaneval: 21.0\n304\t    spon_kl_wikitext2: 9.79\n305\t    spon_kl_arc_c: 47.8\n306\t    spon_kl_mmlu: 59.5\n307\t    teal_wikitext2: 12.48\n308\t    teal_arc_c: 41.5\n309\t    teal_mmlu: 52.0\n310\t    dense_throughput: 42.0\n311\t    kl_only_throughput: 56.5\n312\t    bce_comp_throughput: 49.8\n313\t    spon_kl_throughput: 55.8\n314\t    teal_throughput: 58.2\n315\t    kl_only_extra_mem_mb: 48\n316\t    bce_comp_extra_mem_mb: 304\n317\t  result_rationale: 'BCE+comp在6/7个benchmark上优于KL-only（唯一例外HumanEval仅差1.5 points）。\n318\t    Mean accuracy drop: BCE+comp 7.4% vs KL-only 8.9%——差距一致且显著。 原因：compensation MLP通过per-layer修正补偿了BCE\n319\t    predictor的误差， 提供了比KL更均匀的quality recovery。KL在某些任务（GSM8K -14.6%） 降幅显著——多步推理任务对sparse\n320\t    noise更敏感，KL的layer-adaptive sparsity 并未给reasoning带来额外保护。\n321\t\n322\t    Wall-clock方面，KL-only (1.35x) > BCE+comp (1.19x)： KL唯一的结构性优势是不需要compensation MLP，inference更轻量。\n323\t    但0.16x的speedup差距（大致4ms/token on batch=1） 在多数deployment场景中不是决定性差异。 BCE+comp的304MB\n324\t    extra memory vs KL的48MB是更显著的差异—— 在memory-constrained edge deployment中KL有优势。'\n325\t  tables:\n326\t  - title: 'Table 7: Full benchmark results (Llama 3.1 8B, 50% sparsity)'\n327\t    rows:\n328\t    - Method | Wiki-2↓ | C4↓ | ARC-c↑ | WinoG↑ | MMLU↑ | GSM8K↑ | HumanE↑ | Avg Δ%\n329\t    - Dense | 6.12 | 8.85 | 53.2 | 76.4 | 65.8 | 52.1 | 31.7 | —\n330\t    - TEAL | 12.48 | 16.50 | 41.5 | 62.0 | 52.0 | 30.5 | 15.0 | -24.8\n331\t    - SPON | 10.82 | 14.00 | 46.5 | 67.0 | 57.8 | 40.2 | 21.0 | -14.5\n332\t    - KL-only | 9.80 | 12.65 | 48.2 | 69.8 | 60.1 | 44.5 | 25.0 | -8.9\n333\t    - BCE+comp | 9.40 | 12.15 | 49.5 | 71.2 | 61.5 | 46.0 | 26.5 | -7.4\n334\t    - KL+comp | 8.95 | 11.60 | 50.8 | 72.5 | 62.8 | 48.0 | 28.0 | -5.5\n335\t  - title: 'Table 7b: Inference profiling'\n336\t    rows:\n337\t    - Method | Throughput (tok/s) | Speedup | Extra Memory (MB)\n338\t    - Dense | 42.0 | 1.00x | 0\n339\t    - TEAL | 58.2 | 1.39x | 0\n340\t    - SPON | 57.0 | 1.36x | 0 (absorbed)\n341\t    - KL-only | 56.5 | 1.35x | 48\n342\t    - SPON+KL | 55.8 | 1.33x | 48\n343\t    - BCE+comp | 49.8 | 1.19x | 304\n344\t    - KL+comp | 49.2 | 1.17x | 304\n345\t  figures_description:\n346\t  - 'Fig 7a: Pareto frontier (accuracy vs throughput)。X轴=throughput (tok/s), Y轴=mean\n347\t    benchmark accuracy。BCE+comp和KL-only在accuracy维度相近但KL throughput更高——KL在Pareto frontier上略优于BCE+comp（更快同等质量），但KL+comp是accuracy最高点。'\n348\t  - 'Fig 7b: Radar chart — 5个discriminative benchmarks。BCE+comp的radar面积略大于KL-only。'\n349\t  - 'Fig 7c: Per-benchmark accuracy drop bar chart (grouped by method)。GSM8K是KL-only的最大弱点（-14.6%）。'\n350\t  analysis: Full evaluation确认worst tier叙事：BCE+comp全面优于KL-only（quality）， KL-only优势仅在inference\n351\t    efficiency。Pareto分析显示两种方法在 quality-efficiency tradeoff空间占据不同的niche，不存在一方dominance。\n352\t    KL+comp是global best quality但最慢——说明最优方案是KL+comp而非KL alone。 Paper的Pareto frontier图本身就是有价值的contribution，\n353\t    展示了training signal × compensation × granularity的完整landscape。\n354\t- name: '7-level sparsity sweep: KL vs BCE s² scaling test'\n355\t  plan_id: plan_008\n356\t  description: '30/35/40/45/50/55/60% sparsity sweep, KL-only vs BCE-only。 测试Claim\n357\t    3: KL-BCE delta ~ s²。1 seed per level。'\n358\t  expected_results:\n359\t    kl_ppl_30: 6.55\n360\t    kl_ppl_35: 6.85\n361\t    kl_ppl_40: 7.8\n362\t    kl_ppl_45: 8.6\n363\t    kl_ppl_50: 9.8\n364\t    kl_ppl_55: 16.0\n365\t    kl_ppl_60: 32.0\n366\t    bce_ppl_30: 7.5\n367\t    bce_ppl_35: 11.5\n368\t    bce_ppl_40: 9.8\n369\t    bce_ppl_45: 14.5\n370\t    bce_ppl_50: 28.0\n371\t    bce_ppl_55: 30.0\n372\t    bce_ppl_60: 45.0\n373\t    delta_30: 0.95\n374\t    delta_35: 4.65\n375\t    delta_40: 2.0\n376\t    delta_45: 5.9\n377\t    delta_50: 18.2\n378\t    delta_55: 14.0\n379\t    delta_60: 13.0\n380\t    r2_delta_vs_s2: 0.66\n381\t    r2_delta_vs_s_linear: 0.68\n382\t    r2_delta_vs_s2_excluding_high: 0.81\n383\t    quadratic_coeff_a: 74.9\n384\t    taylor_second_order_error_50pct: 0.28\n385\t    taylor_second_order_error_60pct: 0.55\n386\t  result_rationale: 'Delta呈非单调pattern——在s=0.40处下降（2.00 < 4.65 at s=0.35）， 在s=0.55-0.60处plateau/下降（14.00→13.00）。\n387\t    s=0.40异常原因：BCE在某些sparsity level恰好命中\"easy\"的neuron pruning pattern， 偶尔表现好于趋势。s=0.55-0.60下降原因：KL本身开始collapse（16→32\n388\t    PPL）， 两种方法都在高sparsity下崩溃，delta反而缩小。\n389\t\n390\t    R²(Δ~s²) = 0.66, R²(Δ~s) = 0.68——linear fit甚至略好于quadratic， s²理论叙事不成立。限制在s≤0.50范围内R²=0.81略好，\n391\t    但这是cherry-picking range来fit理论。\n392\t\n393\t    Taylor expansion在s=0.50已有28%相对误差，在s=0.60达55%。 O(s²D²) scaling argument的前提是Taylor展开有效——\n394\t    高sparsity下高阶项不可忽略，理论prediction失效。'\n395\t  tables:\n396\t  - title: 'Table 8a: Sparsity sweep results'\n397\t    rows:\n398\t    - Sparsity | s² | KL PPL | BCE PPL | Δ(BCE−KL)\n399\t    - 30% | 0.090 | 6.55 | 7.50 | 0.95\n400\t    - 35% | 0.122 | 6.85 | 11.50 | 4.65\n401\t    - 40% | 0.160 | 7.80 | 9.80 | 2.00\n402\t    - 45% | 0.202 | 8.60 | 14.50 | 5.90\n403\t    - 50% | 0.250 | 9.80 | 28.00 | 18.20\n404\t    - 55% | 0.302 | 16.00 | 30.00 | 14.00\n405\t    - 60% | 0.360 | 32.00 | 45.00 | 13.00\n406\t  - title: 'Table 8b: Scaling law fit comparison'\n407\t    rows:\n408\t    - Model | R² (all points) | R² (s≤0.50)\n409\t    - Δ ~ a·s² + b | 0.66 | 0.81\n410\t    - Δ ~ a·s + b | 0.68 | 0.82\n411\t    - Δ ~ a·exp(b·s) | 0.72 | 0.78\n412\t  figures_description:\n413\t  - 'Fig 8a: Δ vs s² scatter plot with linear fit (R²=0.66). 同时叠加Δ vs s的linear fit\n414\t    (R²=0.68, dashed)。两条fit线几乎等好，s²无优势。'\n415\t  - 'Fig 8b: PPL vs sparsity双曲线（KL and BCE）。KL在s>0.50后急剧上升，BCE在s>0.35后就持续恶化。两者在s=0.55-0.60区间差距缩小。'\n416\t  - 'Fig 8c: Taylor expansion second-order approximation vs actual delta per sparsity\n417\t    level。在s≥0.50处出现系统性偏差。'\n418\t  analysis: Claim 3（s² scaling）不成立。数据呈现phase-transition而非smooth polynomial关系： BCE在s≈0.45-0.50有一个\"catastrophic\n419\t    transition\"（PPL从14.5跳到28）， 之后plateau；KL在s≈0.55有类似transition（8.6→16）但更晚。 两个transition\n420\t    point的差异——而非smooth quadratic——才是delta的真正驱动力。 论文中不应claim s² scaling law，改为报告\"BCE\n421\t    exits graceful degradation at lower sparsity than KL（~45% vs ~55%），resulting in\n422\t    a phase-transition rather than polynomial relationship in the KL-BCE gap\"。\n423\t- name: Mistral-7B-v0.3 generalization validation\n424\t  plan_id: plan_009\n425\t  description: 'Mistral-7B-v0.3上KL-only vs BCE+comp @ 50%。 Core benchmarks: WikiText-2,\n426\t    ARC-c, MMLU。3 seeds each。'\n427\t  expected_results:\n428\t    mistral_dense_ppl: 7.82\n429\t    mistral_kl_s42_ppl: 14.1\n430\t    mistral_kl_s123_ppl: 14.85\n431\t    mistral_kl_s456_ppl: 13.5\n432\t    mistral_kl_mean_ppl: 14.15\n433\t    mistral_kl_std_ppl: 0.68\n434\t    mistral_kl_ppl_increase_pct: 80.9\n435\t    mistral_kl_arc_c: 41.5\n436\t    mistral_kl_mmlu: 51.8\n437\t    mistral_bce_comp_s42_ppl: 12.5\n438\t    mistral_bce_comp_s123_ppl: 12.8\n439\t    mistral_bce_comp_s456_ppl: 13.1\n440\t    mistral_bce_comp_mean_ppl: 12.8\n441\t    mistral_bce_comp_std_ppl: 0.3\n442\t    mistral_bce_comp_ppl_increase_pct: 63.7\n443\t    mistral_bce_comp_arc_c: 44.8\n444\t    mistral_bce_comp_mmlu: 55.2\n445\t    mistral_kl_vs_bce_comp_gap: 1.35\n446\t    mistral_dense_arc_c: 49.5\n447\t    mistral_dense_mmlu: 62.0\n448\t  result_rationale: 'Mistral-7B-v0.3使用GQA + sliding window attention， KV cache结构与Llama\n449\t    3.1不同（GQA → 更少的KV heads，信息更集中）。 KL训练依赖full output distribution匹配——Mistral的sliding\n450\t    window 导致不同position的logit distribution变化更剧烈， KL predictor更难学习稳定的mask pattern。\n451\t\n452\t    BCE+comp在Mistral上表现更好（12.80 vs 14.15）， gap进一步扩大到+1.35（Llama上是+0.40）。 compensation\n453\t    MLP通过直接修正sparse output对architecture更鲁棒， 不依赖output distribution的稳定性。\n454\t\n455\t    KL PPL increase 80.9%在target range [60, 120]内。 这彻底否定了KL优势的generalizability—— 在第二个architecture上，方向反转且差距更大。'\n456\t  tables:\n457\t  - title: 'Table 9: Mistral-7B-v0.3 results @ 50% sparsity'\n458\t    rows:\n459\t    - Method | PPL | Δ vs Dense (%) | ARC-c | MMLU\n460\t    - Dense | 7.82 | — | 49.5 | 62.0\n461\t    - KL-only | 14.15±0.68 | +80.9 | 41.5 | 51.8\n462\t    - BCE+comp | 12.80±0.30 | +63.7 | 44.8 | 55.2\n463\t  - title: 'Table 9b: Cross-architecture comparison'\n464\t    rows:\n465\t    - Architecture | KL-only PPL Δ% | BCE+comp PPL Δ% | KL−BCE_comp gap\n466\t    - Llama 3.1 8B | +60.1 | +53.6 | +0.40\n467\t    - Mistral-7B-v0.3 | +80.9 | +63.7 | +1.35\n468\t  figures_description:\n469\t  - 'Fig 9: Cross-architecture bar chart。两个model分组，每组KL和BCE+comp并列。Llama上gap小（0.40），Mistral上gap大（1.35）且方向一致（BCE+comp更好）。'\n470\t  analysis: Mistral结果是worst tier的strongest evidence。 不仅KL不优于BCE+comp，差距还在第二个architecture上放大了。\n471\t    这说明KL的\"优势\"（如果存在）是architecture-dependent的， 不具备generalize条件。论文中必须诚实报告cross-architecture\n472\t    inconsistency， 并在characterization framework下解释： \"KL-only的effectiveness取决于output\n473\t    distribution的per-layer stability， 而这是architecture-dependent的property\"。\n474\t- name: LongBench English subset evaluation (4K-32K)\n475\t  plan_id: plan_010\n476\t  description: '全条件在LongBench English subset上评估。 Per-task-type breakdown: single-doc\n477\t    QA, multi-doc QA, summarization, few-shot, code。'\n478\t  expected_results:\n479\t    dense_single_doc_qa: 22.0\n480\t    dense_multi_doc_qa: 35.0\n481\t    dense_summarization: 28.0\n482\t    dense_few_shot: 68.0\n483\t    dense_code: 55.0\n484\t    kl_single_doc_qa: 17.2\n485\t    kl_multi_doc_qa: 26.5\n486\t    kl_summarization: 21.5\n487\t    kl_few_shot: 59.5\n488\t    kl_code: 46.0\n489\t    kl_longbench_avg_drop_pct: 18.5\n490\t    bce_comp_single_doc_qa: 18.5\n491\t    bce_comp_multi_doc_qa: 28.8\n492\t    bce_comp_summarization: 23.2\n493\t    bce_comp_few_shot: 61.0\n494\t    bce_comp_code: 47.5\n495\t    bce_comp_longbench_avg_drop_pct: 14.2\n496\t    spon_kl_single_doc_qa: 17.8\n497\t    spon_kl_multi_doc_qa: 27.0\n498\t    spon_kl_few_shot: 60.0\n499\t    teal_single_doc_qa: 13.5\n500\t    teal_multi_doc_qa: 20.0\n501\t    teal_few_shot: 50.0\n502\t  result_rationale: '长文本任务放大了sparse prediction的错误累积效应。 KL predictor在训练时用512-token\n503\t    sequences—— 长context下distribution shift导致predictor的mask decisions drift， 错误在long-range\n504\t    dependencies中逐步放大。\n505\t\n506\t    BCE+comp的compensation MLP提供了per-layer error correction， 对distribution shift更鲁棒——即使mask不完美，compensation能部分修正。\n507\t    Multi-doc QA差距最大（26.5 vs 28.8，8.7% gap）， 因为multi-doc需要跨文档信息整合，sparse noise影响cross-document\n508\t    attention。\n509\t\n510\t    SPON+KL (17.8 single-doc) 仅略优于KL-only (17.2)， 再次确认SPON+KL的非可加性——在long context下也如此。'\n511\t  tables:\n512\t  - title: 'Table 10: LongBench per-task-type results'\n513\t    rows:\n514\t    - Task Type | Dense | KL-only | BCE+comp | SPON+KL | TEAL\n515\t    - Single-doc QA | 22.0 | 17.2 | 18.5 | 17.8 | 13.5\n516\t    - Multi-doc QA | 35.0 | 26.5 | 28.8 | 27.0 | 20.0\n517\t    - Summarization | 28.0 | 21.5 | 23.2 | 22.0 | 16.5\n518\t    - Few-shot | 68.0 | 59.5 | 61.0 | 60.0 | 50.0\n519\t    - Code | 55.0 | 46.0 | 47.5 | 46.5 | 38.0\n520\t    - Avg Drop % | — | -18.5 | -14.2 | -16.8 | -32.5\n521\t  figures_description:\n522\t  - 'Fig 10: Grouped bar chart per task type。每组5个bars (Dense, KL, BCE+comp, SPON+KL,\n523\t    TEAL)。BCE+comp一致优于KL-only，差距在multi-doc QA最大。'\n524\t  analysis: Long context进一步支持worst tier叙事—— KL-only的degradation在long context下比short\n525\t    context更严重 （avg drop 18.5% vs short-context benchmarks的8.9%）。 BCE+comp更鲁棒（14.2%\n526\t    vs 18.5%），compensation提供了error buffering。 这对NLP venue特别重要——long-context capability是EMNLP\n527\t    reviewer关注的重点。\n528\t- name: MT-Bench evaluation (GPT-4o judge)\n529\t  plan_id: plan_011\n530\t  description: 80个multi-turn questions, 8个categories。GPT-4o作为judge。 测试instruction-following\n531\t    quality under sparsity。\n532\t  expected_results:\n533\t    dense_mt_bench_avg: 7.2\n534\t    kl_mt_bench_avg: 5.95\n535\t    bce_comp_mt_bench_avg: 6.3\n536\t    spon_kl_mt_bench_avg: 6.05\n537\t    teal_mt_bench_avg: 4.8\n538\t    kl_writing: 6.5\n539\t    kl_reasoning: 5.2\n540\t    kl_math: 4.8\n541\t    kl_coding: 5.5\n542\t    bce_comp_writing: 6.8\n543\t    bce_comp_reasoning: 5.8\n544\t    bce_comp_math: 5.2\n545\t    bce_comp_coding: 5.9\n546\t  result_rationale: MT-Bench是multi-turn对话质量的综合测试。 KL-only (5.95) vs BCE+comp (6.30)——差距0.35分在MT-Bench\n547\t    scale上有意义。 Reasoning和math categories差距最大（0.6和0.4分）， 因为多步推理对intermediate representation的准确性要求高，\n548\t    sparse noise在turn间累积。 Compensation MLP提供的error correction在multi-turn setting下尤其有价值，\n549\t    每个turn的correction防止error向后续turns propagation。\n550\t  tables:\n551\t  - title: 'Table 11: MT-Bench scores (GPT-4o judge)'\n552\t    rows:\n553\t    - Method | Avg | Writing | Reasoning | Math | Coding | Roleplay | Extraction |\n554\t      STEM | Humanities\n555\t    - Dense | 7.20 | 7.8 | 6.8 | 6.5 | 7.0 | 7.5 | 7.2 | 7.0 | 7.8\n556\t    - KL-only | 5.95 | 6.5 | 5.2 | 4.8 | 5.5 | 6.5 | 6.0 | 5.8 | 6.3\n557\t    - BCE+comp | 6.30 | 6.8 | 5.8 | 5.2 | 5.9 | 6.8 | 6.2 | 6.2 | 6.5\n558\t    - SPON+KL | 6.05 | 6.6 | 5.3 | 4.9 | 5.6 | 6.5 | 6.1 | 5.9 | 6.5\n559\t    - TEAL | 4.80 | 5.2 | 4.0 | 3.5 | 4.5 | 5.5 | 4.8 | 4.5 | 5.0\n560\t  figures_description:\n561\t  - 'Fig 11: MT-Bench radar chart (8 categories)。Dense最大，BCE+comp > KL-only在所有categories。Reasoning/Math差距最明显。'\n562\t  analysis: 'MT-Bench确认了downstream quality ordering: BCE+comp > KL-only。 在NLP-relevant的instruction-following\n563\t    setting下， compensation的error correction在multi-turn中有cumulative benefit。 对EMNLP\n564\t    submission有利——MT-Bench直接评估NLP应用质量。'\n565\t- name: RULER synthetic long-context evaluation\n566\t  plan_id: plan_012\n567\t  description: 'RULER (4K, 16K) × 3 task types: NIAH-Single, NIAH-MultiKey, Variable\n568\t    Tracking。 Fine-grained capability diagnostics。'\n569\t  expected_results:\n570\t    dense_niah_s_4k: 98.0\n571\t    dense_niah_s_16k: 92.0\n572\t    dense_niah_mk_4k: 85.0\n573\t    dense_niah_mk_16k: 70.0\n574\t    dense_vt_4k: 80.0\n575\t    dense_vt_16k: 62.0\n576\t    kl_niah_s_4k: 88.0\n577\t    kl_niah_s_16k: 70.0\n578\t    kl_niah_mk_4k: 71.0\n579\t    kl_niah_mk_16k: 45.0\n580\t    kl_vt_4k: 64.0\n581\t    kl_vt_16k: 35.0\n582\t    bce_comp_niah_s_4k: 91.0\n583\t    bce_comp_niah_s_16k: 76.0\n584\t    bce_comp_niah_mk_4k: 75.0\n585\t    bce_comp_niah_mk_16k: 52.0\n586\t    bce_comp_vt_4k: 68.0\n587\t    bce_comp_vt_16k: 42.0\n588\t    kl_16k_avg_drop_vs_dense: 31.3\n589\t    bce_comp_16k_avg_drop_vs_dense: 23.5\n590\t  result_rationale: 'RULER的synthetic tasks提供了controlled capability measurement。 16K\n591\t    context下KL-only降幅最大——NIAH-MultiKey从85→45（-47.1%）， Variable Tracking从62→35（-43.5%）。\n592\t    这些任务需要精确的long-range retrieval和state tracking， sparse noise在16K tokens范围内严重干扰attention\n593\t    pattern。\n594\t\n595\t    BCE+comp在所有6个setting上优于KL-only， 16K的NIAH-MultiKey差距7 points（52 vs 45），VT差距7 points（42\n596\t    vs 35）。 Compensation的per-layer correction在长序列下提供了持续的error mitigation。\n597\t\n598\t    KL在4K→16K的degradation slope比BCE+comp更陡， 说明KL predictor的mask decision在序列长度增加时快速恶化——\n599\t    进一步支持\"KL的训练信号不够robust\"的worst-tier叙事。'\n600\t  tables:\n601\t  - title: 'Table 12: RULER results (accuracy %)'\n602\t    rows:\n603\t    - Task | Context | Dense | KL-only | BCE+comp | Δ(KL vs BCE+comp)\n604\t    - NIAH-S | 4K | 98.0 | 88.0 | 91.0 | -3.0\n605\t    - NIAH-S | 16K | 92.0 | 70.0 | 76.0 | -6.0\n606\t    - NIAH-MK | 4K | 85.0 | 71.0 | 75.0 | -4.0\n607\t    - NIAH-MK | 16K | 70.0 | 45.0 | 52.0 | -7.0\n608\t    - VT | 4K | 80.0 | 64.0 | 68.0 | -4.0\n609\t    - VT | 16K | 62.0 | 35.0 | 42.0 | -7.0\n610\t  figures_description:\n611\t  - 'Fig 12: Heatmap (method × task-context)。颜色深浅表示accuracy。KL-only在16K列明显偏暗，BCE+comp介于Dense和KL之间。'\n612\t  analysis: RULER的controlled diagnostics是worst tier的fine-grained evidence。 KL-only在长序列上的capability\n613\t    loss pattern清晰且一致， 作为EMNLP paper的补充diagnostics有说服力。 但RULER本身是P2 priority——如果时间不足，\n614\t    LongBench (plan_010)已经cover了long-context方向， RULER提供的是complementary validation而非必要条件。\n615\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ea246f80-3204-4c6f-a88a-431a28811afc","uuid":"68529acc-2f0c-4927-b261-d7a8b891b465","timestamp":"2026-05-15T17:52:09.737Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_14/projects/distill_sparse_swiglu/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260515T164925/worst/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: KL优势是假象。BCE的核心瓶颈不是loss function而是缺少compensation mechanism。 加上FastForward风格的compensation\n  MLP后，BCE+comp在PPL和downstream tasks上追平甚至反超KL-only。 KL-only训练不稳定（5-seed std > 0.8，2个新seed\n  PPL > 10.5），稳定性劣于BCE+comp。 s²scaling理论不成立（R² < 0.7），linear fit同样好。SPON+KL非可加，Mistral结果方向反转。\n  Paper重心从\"KL eliminates compensation\"转向\"首个系统性taxonomy of training signals × correction\n  granularity for activation sparsity\"，以characterization study投EMNLP Efficient Methods\n  track。\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: Four-condition ablation @ 50% sparsity\n  plan_id: plan_001\n  description: 四条件消融：(a) BCE-only 3 seeds existing, (b) BCE+comp 5 seeds new, (c)\n    KL-only 5 seeds (3 existing + 2 new), (d) KL+comp 3 seeds new。 Headline对比KL-only\n    vs BCE+comp各5 seeds。\n  expected_results:\n    kl_only_s42_ppl: 9.21\n    kl_only_s123_ppl: 9.25\n    kl_only_s456_ppl: 9.14\n    kl_only_s0_ppl: 10.31\n    kl_only_s1_ppl: 11.08\n    kl_only_mean_ppl: 9.8\n    kl_only_std_ppl: 0.87\n    kl_only_model_sparsity: 0.498\n    bce_comp_s42_ppl: 9.18\n    bce_comp_s123_ppl: 9.35\n    bce_comp_s456_ppl: 9.52\n    bce_comp_s0_ppl: 9.28\n    bce_comp_s1_ppl: 9.68\n    bce_comp_mean_ppl: 9.4\n    bce_comp_std_ppl: 0.19\n    bce_comp_model_sparsity: 0.496\n    kl_comp_s42_ppl: 8.82\n    kl_comp_s123_ppl: 8.95\n    kl_comp_s456_ppl: 9.08\n    kl_comp_mean_ppl: 8.95\n    kl_comp_std_ppl: 0.13\n    bce_only_mean_ppl: 28.16\n    kl_vs_bce_comp_gap: 0.4\n    kl_comp_vs_bce_comp_gap: -0.45\n    dense_ppl: 6.12\n  result_rationale: s0和s1两个新seed暴露了KL训练的Lagrangian不稳定性。 Lagrangian乘子在这两个seed下出现λ震荡（未收敛到稳定平衡点），\n    导致sparsity在0.47-0.52间振荡，predictor未充分优化。 s456的teal异常（13.58 vs 12.08/11.91）已经暗示了seed敏感性，\n    新seed进一步确认：KL+Lagrangian在某些初始化下不稳定， std=0.87远高于BCE+comp的0.19。 BCE+comp通过compensation\n    MLP有效纠正了BCE predictor的per-neuron误差， 从28.16降至9.40——compensation消除了~67%的BCE quality\n    gap。 KL+comp是最佳条件（8.95），说明compensation对KL也有帮助， 而非KL已经\"不需要\"compensation。核心发现：compensation是通用质量提升手段，\n    KL的\"优势\"仅是在不公平对比（有comp vs 无comp）下的假象。\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Table 1: Four-condition WikiText-2 PPL @ 50% sparsity (Llama 3.1 8B)'\n    rows:\n    - Condition | Seeds | Mean PPL | Std | Δ vs Dense (%)\n    - Dense (no sparsity) | — | 6.12 | — | —\n    - BCE-only | 3 | 28.16 | 0.22 | +360.1%\n    - BCE+compensation | 5 | 9.40 | 0.19 | +53.6%\n    - KL-only | 5 | 9.80 | 0.87 | +60.1%\n    - KL+compensation | 3 | 8.95 | 0.13 | +46.2%\n  - title: 'Table 1b: Per-seed breakdown'\n    rows:\n    - Seed | BCE-only | BCE+comp | KL-only | KL+comp\n    - s42  | 27.96    | 9.18     | 9.21    | 8.82\n    - s123 | 28.38    | 9.35     | 9.25    | 8.95\n    - s456 | 28.14    | 9.52     | 9.14    | 9.08\n    - s0   | —        | 9.28     | 10.31   | —\n    - s1   | —        | 9.68     | 11.08   | —\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 1a: Boxplot of WikiText-2 PPL across 4 conditions. KL-only box明显比BCE+comp宽（whisker覆盖9.14-11.08），且median偏高。BCE+comp\n    box最窄最低。KL+comp最低但仅3 seeds。'\n  - 'Fig 1b: Per-seed PPL scatter plot with mean±std error bars。突出s0/s1两个KL outlier。'\n  - 'Fig 1c: Training loss curves (KL loss for KL conditions, BCE loss for BCE conditions)。KL\n    s0和s1的loss曲线后半段出现oscillation，lambda未收敛。'\n  analysis: 'headline claim \"KL eliminates compensation\"不成立。BCE+comp (9.40) < KL-only\n    (9.80)， 且KL-only的高方差使其在deployment中不可靠。 KL+comp是全局最佳（8.95），但这反证了compensation的通用价值，\n    而非KL的独特优势。Narrative需从\"KL beats BCE+comp\"转向 \"characterization: 不同training signal\n    × compensation的交互效应\"。 唯一保留的KL叙事：KL-only在不使用compensation时确实优于BCE-only（9.80 vs 28.16），\n    但这个\"免compensation\"优势在BCE+comp面前消失。'\n- name: STE baseline (KL + Straight-Through Estimator)\n  plan_id: plan_002\n  description: 用STE替换Gumbel-sigmoid作为梯度通路，保留KL loss不变。 隔离KL优势来源：loss function还是relaxation\n    method。3 seeds。\n  expected_results:\n    ste_kl_s42_ppl: 9.85\n    ste_kl_s123_ppl: 10.1\n    ste_kl_s456_ppl: 9.72\n    ste_kl_mean_ppl: 9.89\n    ste_kl_std_ppl: 0.19\n    ste_kl_model_sparsity: 0.497\n    ste_kl_vs_gumbel_kl_gap: 0.09\n    ste_kl_training_steps_to_converge: 950\n  result_rationale: STE+KL (9.89) ≈ Gumbel+KL (9.80)，差距仅0.09 PPL，在KL-only自身方差（std=0.87）\n    内可忽略。这说明Gumbel-sigmoid relaxation对最终质量贡献极小， KL loss gradient本身才是驱动因素。 表面上这支持\"KL是关键\"——但结合plan_001的结论（BCE+comp追平KL），\n    更准确的解读是：任何能传递端到端output-distribution信息的training signal （无论STE还是Gumbel路径）都能达到~9.8\n    PPL，而BCE+comp通过不同路径达到了9.4。 relaxation method不重要这一事实削弱了论文的technical novelty—— \"Gumbel\n    + KL\"不是一个不可替代的组合，STE+KL同样有效。\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Table 2: Gradient estimator ablation (KL loss fixed)'\n    rows:\n    - Method | Mean PPL | Std | Sparsity\n    - Gumbel-sigmoid + KL | 9.80 | 0.87 | 0.498\n    - STE + KL | 9.89 | 0.19 | 0.497\n    - BCE-only (ref) | 28.16 | 0.22 | 0.496\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 2: Training curves overlay — Gumbel+KL vs STE+KL。两条KL loss曲线高度重合，STE略慢收敛（~50\n    steps），最终值相同。STE的sparsity曲线更平滑（无Gumbel温度退火的阶梯）。'\n  analysis: STE≈Gumbel确认relaxation method不是KL优势的来源。 但结合BCE+comp追平KL的结果，因果归因链断裂： KL的优势不来自relaxation，也不来自\"独特的loss\n    function\"—— 因为compensation可以弥补BCE的不足。 论文无法claim \"our Gumbel-KL combination is\n    uniquely effective\"。 可作为honest ablation报告，支持characterization study叙事。 额外发现：STE+KL的std=0.19远低于Gumbel+KL的0.87，\n    说明Gumbel温度退火引入了额外的seed sensitivity（进一步削弱Gumbel的必要性）。\n- name: Iso-compute BCE vs KL\n  plan_id: plan_003\n  description: KL每步需full forward pass计算output logits（~2x FLOPs per step vs BCE用cached\n    targets）。 给BCE等量total FLOPs（extended training），评估compute-normalized比较。3 seeds。\n  expected_results:\n    kl_flops_per_step: 4.2e14\n    bce_flops_per_step: 1.8e14\n    kl_total_training_flops: 4.2e17\n    bce_extended_steps: 2333\n    bce_extended_s42_ppl: 24.5\n    bce_extended_s123_ppl: 25.1\n    bce_extended_s456_ppl: 24.8\n    bce_extended_mean_ppl: 24.8\n    bce_extended_std_ppl: 0.3\n    bce_1000step_mean_ppl: 28.16\n    bce_improvement_from_extended: -3.36\n    kl_training_time_min: 42\n    bce_extended_training_time_min: 58\n  result_rationale: BCE extended training从28.16降至24.80——额外1333步仅带来3.36 PPL改善。 BCE的收敛曲线在~800步后进入plateau，更多步数的边际收益递减。\n    这是因为BCE的per-neuron factorized gradient本身信息不足： 无论训练多久，BCE无法学到neuron间的joint interaction。\n    但这个结果不支持\"KL需要更多compute所以不公平\"的reviewer concern—— 即使给BCE等量compute，差距仍然巨大（24.80 vs\n    9.80）。 然而结合plan_001，真正的解决方案不是更多BCE training， 而是加compensation（9.40）——这才是compute的正确使用方式。\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Table 3: Iso-compute comparison'\n    rows:\n    - Condition | Steps | Total FLOPs | Mean PPL | Wall Time\n    - KL-only (1000 steps) | 1000 | 4.2e17 | 9.80 | 42 min\n    - BCE-only (1000 steps) | 1000 | 1.8e17 | 28.16 | 25 min\n    - BCE-only (extended, iso-FLOP) | 2333 | 4.2e17 | 24.80 | 58 min\n    - BCE+comp (1000+500 steps) | 1500 | 3.5e17 | 9.40 | 50 min\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 3: PPL vs total FLOPs曲线。KL在~4e17 FLOPs处达到9.80；BCE extended在同样FLOPs仅到24.80；BCE+comp在更少FLOPs（3.5e17）就到9.40。说明compute不是瓶颈，compensation\n    architecture才是。'\n  analysis: Iso-compute消除了\"KL wins because more compute\"的reviewer concern。 但同时也表明：BCE的瓶颈不是compute，而是loss\n    function的结构性局限。 当compensation弥补了这个局限后（BCE+comp），以更少compute达到更好结果。 论文中可诚实报告：KL确实compute-efficient（fewer\n    total FLOPs to reach good quality）， 但\"KL eliminates compensation\"的claim仍然不成立。\n- name: SPON reimplementation & reproduction\n  plan_id: plan_004\n  description: 在Llama 3.1 8B上重现SPON（static learnable bias + KL training）。 5个QA benchmarks验证reproduction质量。\n  expected_results:\n    spon_wikitext2_ppl: 10.82\n    spon_model_sparsity: 0.5\n    spon_params_per_layer: 4096\n    spon_total_params: 131072\n    spon_training_time_min: 15\n    spon_arc_c: 50.2\n    spon_arc_e: 77.5\n    spon_boolq: 79.8\n    spon_piqa: 78.1\n    spon_winogrande: 73.6\n    published_arc_c: 50.8\n    published_arc_e: 78.2\n    published_boolq: 80.5\n    published_piqa: 78.8\n    published_winogrande: 74.2\n    reproduction_max_gap: 1.0\n  result_rationale: SPON方法简单（每层仅hidden_dim个learnable参数），超参数空间小， reproduction误差主要来自KL训练的随机性和calibration\n    data差异。 所有5个benchmark与published results差距 < 1 point，reproduction合格。 PPL=10.82确认static\n    correction的天花板：input-independent bias只能修正 average-case drift，无法适应per-input neuron\n    importance变化。 这为plan_005的composition实验提供了valid SPON baseline。\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Table 4: SPON reproduction on 5 QA benchmarks'\n    rows:\n    - Benchmark | Published | Ours | Δ\n    - ARC-c | 50.8 | 50.2 | -0.6\n    - ARC-e | 78.2 | 77.5 | -0.7\n    - BoolQ | 80.5 | 79.8 | -0.7\n    - PIQA | 78.8 | 78.1 | -0.7\n    - WinoGrande | 74.2 | 73.6 | -0.6\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: SPON reproduction成功，5个benchmark最大偏差0.7 points。 PPL=10.82介于KL-only (9.80)和training-free\n    (~12.5)之间， 符合static correction的预期能力范围。\n- name: SPON + KL predictor composition & additivity test\n  plan_id: plan_005\n  description: 同时应用SPON bias correction + KL contextual prediction。 Output-space linearity测试和per-layer正交性分析。3\n    seeds。\n  expected_results:\n    spon_kl_s42_ppl: 9.55\n    spon_kl_s123_ppl: 9.78\n    spon_kl_s456_ppl: 10.05\n    spon_kl_mean_ppl: 9.79\n    spon_kl_std_ppl: 0.25\n    spon_only_ppl: 10.82\n    kl_only_mean_ppl: 9.8\n    teal_baseline_ppl: 12.5\n    spon_improvement_over_teal: 1.68\n    kl_improvement_over_teal: 2.7\n    predicted_additive_ppl: 8.12\n    actual_combined_ppl: 9.79\n    additivity_residual_ppl: 1.67\n    additivity_ratio: 0.62\n    logit_residual_norm_ratio: 0.38\n    mean_cos_similarity: 0.34\n    layers_with_cos_gt_03: 20\n    max_cos_similarity_layer: 0.62\n  result_rationale: SPON+KL (9.79) ≈ KL-only (9.80)——组合几乎没有额外收益。 predicted additive\n    PPL=8.12 vs actual=9.79，additivity ratio仅0.62。 原因：SPON的static bias和KL predictor的contextual\n    correction在output space 高度相关——两者都在修正同一组\"容易误杀\"的neurons的drift。 cos similarity分析确认：在中间层（layer\n    12-20），两种correction方向高度一致 （cos > 0.4），说明它们修正的是同一类误差而非互补的不同误差源。 Claim 2（可加性）在worst\n    tier下彻底不成立。 logit_residual_norm_ratio=0.38 >> 0（如果可加应接近0）， interaction term不可忽略。\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Table 5: SPON + KL composition results'\n    rows:\n    - Condition | PPL | Improvement over TEAL\n    - TEAL baseline | 12.50 | —\n    - SPON only | 10.82 | 1.68\n    - KL only | 9.80 | 2.70\n    - SPON+KL (actual) | 9.79 | 2.71\n    - SPON+KL (additive prediction) | 8.12 | 4.38\n  - title: 'Table 5b: Additivity metrics'\n    rows:\n    - Metric | Value\n    - Additivity ratio | 0.62\n    - Logit residual norm ratio | 0.38\n    - Mean cos(c_s, c_θ) | 0.34\n    - Layers with cos > 0.3 | 20/32\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 5a: Per-layer cos similarity heatmap (32 layers × 3 seeds)。中间层（12-20）呈暖色（cos\n    > 0.4），首尾层冷色（cos < 0.2）。说明interaction集中在中间表征层。'\n  - 'Fig 5b: Logit residual magnitude per layer bar chart。中间层residual最大，与cos similarity\n    pattern一致。'\n  analysis: SPON+KL composition不满足可加性假设（Claim 2不成立）。 但这本身是一个有价值的empirical finding——\n    \"static和contextual corrections的overlap分析\"可作为standalone贡献。 论文中不再claim可加性，改为report\n    interaction structure： \"static和contextual corrections在中间层高度相关， suggesting both\n    target the same error mode (average-case neuron importance drift)\"。 这支持characterization\n    study的叙事方向。\n- name: Training-free baselines @ 50% sparsity\n  plan_id: plan_006\n  description: TEAL (activation magnitude + greedy allocation), WINA (weight-informed\n    scoring), R-Sparse (rank-aware scoring)。建立三层比较：training-free < static-learned\n    < contextual-learned。\n  expected_results:\n    teal_vanilla_ppl: 12.48\n    wina_ppl: 15.8\n    rsparse_ppl: 14.2\n    dense_ppl: 6.12\n    teal_vanilla_sparsity: 0.5\n    wina_sparsity: 0.5\n    rsparse_sparsity: 0.5\n    teal_vs_dense_pct: 103.9\n    wina_vs_dense_pct: 158.2\n    rsparse_vs_dense_pct: 132.0\n  result_rationale: TEAL表现最好（12.48），因为activation magnitude是neuron importance的直接proxy，\n    加上greedy per-layer allocation自适应地保护关键层。 R-Sparse (14.20)次之——rank-aware scoring考虑了相对重要性但无跨层allocation。\n    WINA最差（15.80）——weight-informed scoring在SwiGLU gate×up结构下信号较弱， weight magnitude与activation\n    importance的相关性不如直接用activation。 这建立了清晰的tier结构：training-free（12-16）<< SPON（10.8）<<\n    contextual（9.4-9.8）。 注意这里的TEAL使用vanilla activation magnitude（非predictor scores），\n    与registry中基于predictor scores的\"teal_sparse_ppl\"不同。\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Table 6: Training-free baselines @ 50% sparsity'\n    rows:\n    - Method | WikiText-2 PPL | Δ vs Dense (%)\n    - Dense | 6.12 | —\n    - TEAL (activation magnitude) | 12.48 | +103.9%\n    - R-Sparse | 14.20 | +132.0%\n    - WINA | 15.80 | +158.2%\n    - SPON (static learned) | 10.82 | +76.8%\n    - KL-only (contextual) | 9.80 | +60.1%\n    - BCE+comp (contextual) | 9.40 | +53.6%\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 6: PPL bar chart (horizontal) 按质量排序。清晰展示training-free → static → contextual的层级。BCE+comp和KL-only在误差bar内重叠。'\n  analysis: 三层层级结构清晰，training-free到contextual有6-7 PPL points的gap。 这验证了learned prediction的价值。在worst\n    tier下， KL-only和BCE+comp处于同一tier（contextual），彼此差距不显著。 paper的taxonomy贡献成立：不同training\n    signal在不同granularity下的表现分布 本身就是有价值的empirical map。\n- name: Full benchmark suite + wall-clock profiling\n  plan_id: plan_007\n  description: 所有条件在Llama 3.1 8B上的完整评估：WikiText-2, C4, ARC-c, WinoGrande, MMLU, GSM8K,\n    HumanEval。Wall-clock profiling和Pareto frontier。\n  expected_results:\n    dense_wikitext2: 6.12\n    dense_c4: 8.85\n    dense_arc_c: 53.2\n    dense_winogrande: 76.4\n    dense_mmlu: 65.8\n    dense_gsm8k: 52.1\n    dense_humaneval: 31.7\n    kl_wikitext2: 9.8\n    kl_c4: 12.65\n    kl_arc_c: 48.2\n    kl_winogrande: 69.8\n    kl_mmlu: 60.1\n    kl_gsm8k: 44.5\n    kl_humaneval: 25.0\n    kl_mean_acc_drop_vs_dense_pct: 8.9\n    bce_comp_wikitext2: 9.4\n    bce_comp_c4: 12.15\n    bce_comp_arc_c: 49.5\n    bce_comp_winogrande: 71.2\n    bce_comp_mmlu: 61.5\n    bce_comp_gsm8k: 46.0\n    bce_comp_humaneval: 26.5\n    bce_comp_mean_acc_drop_vs_dense_pct: 7.4\n    spon_wikitext2: 10.82\n    spon_c4: 14.0\n    spon_arc_c: 46.5\n    spon_winogrande: 67.0\n    spon_mmlu: 57.8\n    spon_gsm8k: 40.2\n    spon_humaneval: 21.0\n    spon_kl_wikitext2: 9.79\n    spon_kl_arc_c: 47.8\n    spon_kl_mmlu: 59.5\n    teal_wikitext2: 12.48\n    teal_arc_c: 41.5\n    teal_mmlu: 52.0\n    dense_throughput: 42.0\n    kl_only_throughput: 56.5\n    bce_comp_throughput: 49.8\n    spon_kl_throughput: 55.8\n    teal_throughput: 58.2\n    kl_only_extra_mem_mb: 48\n    bce_comp_extra_mem_mb: 304\n  result_rationale: 'BCE+comp在6/7个benchmark上优于KL-only（唯一例外HumanEval仅差1.5 points）。\n    Mean accuracy drop: BCE+comp 7.4% vs KL-only 8.9%——差距一致且显著。 原因：compensation MLP通过per-layer修正补偿了BCE\n    predictor的误差， 提供了比KL更均匀的quality recovery。KL在某些任务（GSM8K -14.6%） 降幅显著——多步推理任务对sparse\n    noise更敏感，KL的layer-adaptive sparsity 并未给reasoning带来额外保护。\n\n    Wall-clock方面，KL-only (1.35x) > BCE+comp (1.19x)： KL唯一的结构性优势是不需要compensation MLP，inference更轻量。\n    但0.16x的speedup差距（大致4ms/token on batch=1） 在多数deployment场景中不是决定性差异。 BCE+comp的304MB\n    extra memory vs KL的48MB是更显著的差异—— 在memory-constrained edge deployment中KL有优势。'\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Table 7: Full benchmark results (Llama 3.1 8B, 50% sparsity)'\n    rows:\n    - Method | Wiki-2↓ | C4↓ | ARC-c↑ | WinoG↑ | MMLU↑ | GSM8K↑ | HumanE↑ | Avg Δ%\n    - Dense | 6.12 | 8.85 | 53.2 | 76.4 | 65.8 | 52.1 | 31.7 | —\n    - TEAL | 12.48 | 16.50 | 41.5 | 62.0 | 52.0 | 30.5 | 15.0 | -24.8\n    - SPON | 10.82 | 14.00 | 46.5 | 67.0 | 57.8 | 40.2 | 21.0 | -14.5\n    - KL-only | 9.80 | 12.65 | 48.2 | 69.8 | 60.1 | 44.5 | 25.0 | -8.9\n    - BCE+comp | 9.40 | 12.15 | 49.5 | 71.2 | 61.5 | 46.0 | 26.5 | -7.4\n    - KL+comp | 8.95 | 11.60 | 50.8 | 72.5 | 62.8 | 48.0 | 28.0 | -5.5\n  - title: 'Table 7b: Inference profiling'\n    rows:\n    - Method | Throughput (tok/s) | Speedup | Extra Memory (MB)\n    - Dense | 42.0 | 1.00x | 0\n    - TEAL | 58.2 | 1.39x | 0\n    - SPON | 57.0 | 1.36x | 0 (absorbed)\n    - KL-only | 56.5 | 1.35x | 48\n    - SPON+KL | 55.8 | 1.33x | 48\n    - BCE+comp | 49.8 | 1.19x | 304\n    - KL+comp | 49.2 | 1.17x | 304\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 7a: Pareto frontier (accuracy vs throughput)。X轴=throughput (tok/s), Y轴=mean\n    benchmark accuracy。BCE+comp和KL-only在accuracy维度相近但KL throughput更高——KL在Pareto frontier上略优于BCE+comp（更快同等质量），但KL+comp是accuracy最高点。'\n  - 'Fig 7b: Radar chart — 5个discriminative benchmarks。BCE+comp的radar面积略大于KL-only。'\n  - 'Fig 7c: Per-benchmark accuracy drop bar chart (grouped by method)。GSM8K是KL-only的最大弱点（-14.6%）。'\n  analysis: Full evaluation确认worst tier叙事：BCE+comp全面优于KL-only（quality）， KL-only优势仅在inference\n    efficiency。Pareto分析显示两种方法在 quality-efficiency tradeoff空间占据不同的niche，不存在一方dominance。\n    KL+comp是global best quality但最慢——说明最优方案是KL+comp而非KL alone。 Paper的Pareto frontier图本身就是有价值的contribution，\n    展示了training signal × compensation × granularity的完整landscape。\n- name: '7-level sparsity sweep: KL vs BCE s² scaling test'\n  plan_id: plan_008\n  description: '30/35/40/45/50/55/60% sparsity sweep, KL-only vs BCE-only。 测试Claim\n    3: KL-BCE delta ~ s²。1 seed per level。'\n  expected_results:\n    kl_ppl_30: 6.55\n    kl_ppl_35: 6.85\n    kl_ppl_40: 7.8\n    kl_ppl_45: 8.6\n    kl_ppl_50: 9.8\n    kl_ppl_55: 16.0\n    kl_ppl_60: 32.0\n    bce_ppl_30: 7.5\n    bce_ppl_35: 11.5\n    bce_ppl_40: 9.8\n    bce_ppl_45: 14.5\n    bce_ppl_50: 28.0\n    bce_ppl_55: 30.0\n    bce_ppl_60: 45.0\n    delta_30: 0.95\n    delta_35: 4.65\n    delta_40: 2.0\n    delta_45: 5.9\n    delta_50: 18.2\n    delta_55: 14.0\n    delta_60: 13.0\n    r2_delta_vs_s2: 0.66\n    r2_delta_vs_s_linear: 0.68\n    r2_delta_vs_s2_excluding_high: 0.81\n    quadratic_coeff_a: 74.9\n    taylor_second_order_error_50pct: 0.28\n    taylor_second_order_error_60pct: 0.55\n  result_rationale: 'Delta呈非单调pattern——在s=0.40处下降（2.00 < 4.65 at s=0.35）， 在s=0.55-0.60处plateau/下降（14.00→13.00）。\n    s=0.40异常原因：BCE在某些sparsity level恰好命中\"easy\"的neuron pruning pattern， 偶尔表现好于趋势。s=0.55-0.60下降原因：KL本身开始collapse（16→32\n    PPL）， 两种方法都在高sparsity下崩溃，delta反而缩小。\n\n    R²(Δ~s²) = 0.66, R²(Δ~s) = 0.68——linear fit甚至略好于quadratic， s²理论叙事不成立。限制在s≤0.50范围内R²=0.81略好，\n    但这是cherry-picking range来fit理论。\n\n    Taylor expansion在s=0.50已有28%相对误差，在s=0.60达55%。 O(s²D²) scaling argument的前提是Taylor展开有效——\n    高sparsity下高阶项不可忽略，理论prediction失效。'\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Table 8a: Sparsity sweep results'\n    rows:\n    - Sparsity | s² | KL PPL | BCE PPL | Δ(BCE−KL)\n    - 30% | 0.090 | 6.55 | 7.50 | 0.95\n    - 35% | 0.122 | 6.85 | 11.50 | 4.65\n    - 40% | 0.160 | 7.80 | 9.80 | 2.00\n    - 45% | 0.202 | 8.60 | 14.50 | 5.90\n    - 50% | 0.250 | 9.80 | 28.00 | 18.20\n    - 55% | 0.302 | 16.00 | 30.00 | 14.00\n    - 60% | 0.360 | 32.00 | 45.00 | 13.00\n  - title: 'Table 8b: Scaling law fit comparison'\n    rows:\n    - Model | R² (all points) | R² (s≤0.50)\n    - Δ ~ a·s² + b | 0.66 | 0.81\n    - Δ ~ a·s + b | 0.68 | 0.82\n    - Δ ~ a·exp(b·s) | 0.72 | 0.78\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 8a: Δ vs s² scatter plot with linear fit (R²=0.66). 同时叠加Δ vs s的linear fit\n    (R²=0.68, dashed)。两条fit线几乎等好，s²无优势。'\n  - 'Fig 8b: PPL vs sparsity双曲线（KL and BCE）。KL在s>0.50后急剧上升，BCE在s>0.35后就持续恶化。两者在s=0.55-0.60区间差距缩小。'\n  - 'Fig 8c: Taylor expansion second-order approximation vs actual delta per sparsity\n    level。在s≥0.50处出现系统性偏差。'\n  analysis: Claim 3（s² scaling）不成立。数据呈现phase-transition而非smooth polynomial关系： BCE在s≈0.45-0.50有一个\"catastrophic\n    transition\"（PPL从14.5跳到28）， 之后plateau；KL在s≈0.55有类似transition（8.6→16）但更晚。 两个transition\n    point的差异——而非smooth quadratic——才是delta的真正驱动力。 论文中不应claim s² scaling law，改为报告\"BCE\n    exits graceful degradation at lower sparsity than KL（~45% vs ~55%），resulting in\n    a phase-transition rather than polynomial relationship in the KL-BCE gap\"。\n- name: Mistral-7B-v0.3 generalization validation\n  plan_id: plan_009\n  description: 'Mistral-7B-v0.3上KL-only vs BCE+comp @ 50%。 Core benchmarks: WikiText-2,\n    ARC-c, MMLU。3 seeds each。'\n  expected_results:\n    mistral_dense_ppl: 7.82\n    mistral_kl_s42_ppl: 14.1\n    mistral_kl_s123_ppl: 14.85\n    mistral_kl_s456_ppl: 13.5\n    mistral_kl_mean_ppl: 14.15\n    mistral_kl_std_ppl: 0.68\n    mistral_kl_ppl_increase_pct: 80.9\n    mistral_kl_arc_c: 41.5\n    mistral_kl_mmlu: 51.8\n    mistral_bce_comp_s42_ppl: 12.5\n    mistral_bce_comp_s123_ppl: 12.8\n    mistral_bce_comp_s456_ppl: 13.1\n    mistral_bce_comp_mean_ppl: 12.8\n    mistral_bce_comp_std_ppl: 0.3\n    mistral_bce_comp_ppl_increase_pct: 63.7\n    mistral_bce_comp_arc_c: 44.8\n    mistral_bce_comp_mmlu: 55.2\n    mistral_kl_vs_bce_comp_gap: 1.35\n    mistral_dense_arc_c: 49.5\n    mistral_dense_mmlu: 62.0\n  result_rationale: 'Mistral-7B-v0.3使用GQA + sliding window attention， KV cache结构与Llama\n    3.1不同（GQA → 更少的KV heads，信息更集中）。 KL训练依赖full output distribution匹配——Mistral的sliding\n    window 导致不同position的logit distribution变化更剧烈， KL predictor更难学习稳定的mask pattern。\n\n    BCE+comp在Mistral上表现更好（12.80 vs 14.15）， gap进一步扩大到+1.35（Llama上是+0.40）。 compensation\n    MLP通过直接修正sparse output对architecture更鲁棒， 不依赖output distribution的稳定性。\n\n    KL PPL increase 80.9%在target range [60, 120]内。 这彻底否定了KL优势的generalizability—— 在第二个architecture上，方向反转且差距更大。'\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Table 9: Mistral-7B-v0.3 results @ 50% sparsity'\n    rows:\n    - Method | PPL | Δ vs Dense (%) | ARC-c | MMLU\n    - Dense | 7.82 | — | 49.5 | 62.0\n    - KL-only | 14.15±0.68 | +80.9 | 41.5 | 51.8\n    - BCE+comp | 12.80±0.30 | +63.7 | 44.8 | 55.2\n  - title: 'Table 9b: Cross-architecture comparison'\n    rows:\n    - Architecture | KL-only PPL Δ% | BCE+comp PPL Δ% | KL−BCE_comp gap\n    - Llama 3.1 8B | +60.1 | +53.6 | +0.40\n    - Mistral-7B-v0.3 | +80.9 | +63.7 | +1.35\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 9: Cross-architecture bar chart。两个model分组，每组KL和BCE+comp并列。Llama上gap小（0.40），Mistral上gap大（1.35）且方向一致（BCE+comp更好）。'\n  analysis: Mistral结果是worst tier的strongest evidence。 不仅KL不优于BCE+comp，差距还在第二个architecture上放大了。\n    这说明KL的\"优势\"（如果存在）是architecture-dependent的， 不具备generalize条件。论文中必须诚实报告cross-architecture\n    inconsistency， 并在characterization framework下解释： \"KL-only的effectiveness取决于output\n    distribution的per-layer stability， 而这是architecture-dependent的property\"。\n- name: LongBench English subset evaluation (4K-32K)\n  plan_id: plan_010\n  description: '全条件在LongBench English subset上评估。 Per-task-type breakdown: single-doc\n    QA, multi-doc QA, summarization, few-shot, code。'\n  expected_results:\n    dense_single_doc_qa: 22.0\n    dense_multi_doc_qa: 35.0\n    dense_summarization: 28.0\n    dense_few_shot: 68.0\n    dense_code: 55.0\n    kl_single_doc_qa: 17.2\n    kl_multi_doc_qa: 26.5\n    kl_summarization: 21.5\n    kl_few_shot: 59.5\n    kl_code: 46.0\n    kl_longbench_avg_drop_pct: 18.5\n    bce_comp_single_doc_qa: 18.5\n    bce_comp_multi_doc_qa: 28.8\n    bce_comp_summarization: 23.2\n    bce_comp_few_shot: 61.0\n    bce_comp_code: 47.5\n    bce_comp_longbench_avg_drop_pct: 14.2\n    spon_kl_single_doc_qa: 17.8\n    spon_kl_multi_doc_qa: 27.0\n    spon_kl_few_shot: 60.0\n    teal_single_doc_qa: 13.5\n    teal_multi_doc_qa: 20.0\n    teal_few_shot: 50.0\n  result_rationale: '长文本任务放大了sparse prediction的错误累积效应。 KL predictor在训练时用512-token\n    sequences—— 长context下distribution shift导致predictor的mask decisions drift， 错误在long-range\n    dependencies中逐步放大。\n\n    BCE+comp的compensation MLP提供了per-layer error correction， 对distribution shift更鲁棒——即使mask不完美，compensation能部分修正。\n    Multi-doc QA差距最大（26.5 vs 28.8，8.7% gap）， 因为multi-doc需要跨文档信息整合，sparse noise影响cross-document\n    attention。\n\n    SPON+KL (17.8 single-doc) 仅略优于KL-only (17.2)， 再次确认SPON+KL的非可加性——在long context下也如此。'\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Table 10: LongBench per-task-type results'\n    rows:\n    - Task Type | Dense | KL-only | BCE+comp | SPON+KL | TEAL\n    - Single-doc QA | 22.0 | 17.2 | 18.5 | 17.8 | 13.5\n    - Multi-doc QA | 35.0 | 26.5 | 28.8 | 27.0 | 20.0\n    - Summarization | 28.0 | 21.5 | 23.2 | 22.0 | 16.5\n    - Few-shot | 68.0 | 59.5 | 61.0 | 60.0 | 50.0\n    - Code | 55.0 | 46.0 | 47.5 | 46.5 | 38.0\n    - Avg Drop % | — | -18.5 | -14.2 | -16.8 | -32.5\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 10: Grouped bar chart per task type。每组5个bars (Dense, KL, BCE+comp, SPON+KL,\n    TEAL)。BCE+comp一致优于KL-only，差距在multi-doc QA最大。'\n  analysis: Long context进一步支持worst tier叙事—— KL-only的degradation在long context下比short\n    context更严重 （avg drop 18.5% vs short-context benchmarks的8.9%）。 BCE+comp更鲁棒（14.2%\n    vs 18.5%），compensation提供了error buffering。 这对NLP venue特别重要——long-context capability是EMNLP\n    reviewer关注的重点。\n- name: MT-Bench evaluation (GPT-4o judge)\n  plan_id: plan_011\n  description: 80个multi-turn questions, 8个categories。GPT-4o作为judge。 测试instruction-following\n    quality under sparsity。\n  expected_results:\n    dense_mt_bench_avg: 7.2\n    kl_mt_bench_avg: 5.95\n    bce_comp_mt_bench_avg: 6.3\n    spon_kl_mt_bench_avg: 6.05\n    teal_mt_bench_avg: 4.8\n    kl_writing: 6.5\n    kl_reasoning: 5.2\n    kl_math: 4.8\n    kl_coding: 5.5\n    bce_comp_writing: 6.8\n    bce_comp_reasoning: 5.8\n    bce_comp_math: 5.2\n    bce_comp_coding: 5.9\n  result_rationale: MT-Bench是multi-turn对话质量的综合测试。 KL-only (5.95) vs BCE+comp (6.30)——差距0.35分在MT-Bench\n    scale上有意义。 Reasoning和math categories差距最大（0.6和0.4分）， 因为多步推理对intermediate representation的准确性要求高，\n    sparse noise在turn间累积。 Compensation MLP提供的error correction在multi-turn setting下尤其有价值，\n    每个turn的correction防止error向后续turns propagation。\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Table 11: MT-Bench scores (GPT-4o judge)'\n    rows:\n    - Method | Avg | Writing | Reasoning | Math | Coding | Roleplay | Extraction |\n      STEM | Humanities\n    - Dense | 7.20 | 7.8 | 6.8 | 6.5 | 7.0 | 7.5 | 7.2 | 7.0 | 7.8\n    - KL-only | 5.95 | 6.5 | 5.2 | 4.8 | 5.5 | 6.5 | 6.0 | 5.8 | 6.3\n    - BCE+comp | 6.30 | 6.8 | 5.8 | 5.2 | 5.9 | 6.8 | 6.2 | 6.2 | 6.5\n    - SPON+KL | 6.05 | 6.6 | 5.3 | 4.9 | 5.6 | 6.5 | 6.1 | 5.9 | 6.5\n    - TEAL | 4.80 | 5.2 | 4.0 | 3.5 | 4.5 | 5.5 | 4.8 | 4.5 | 5.0\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 11: MT-Bench radar chart (8 categories)。Dense最大，BCE+comp > KL-only在所有categories。Reasoning/Math差距最明显。'\n  analysis: 'MT-Bench确认了downstream quality ordering: BCE+comp > KL-only。 在NLP-relevant的instruction-following\n    setting下， compensation的error correction在multi-turn中有cumulative benefit。 对EMNLP\n    submission有利——MT-Bench直接评估NLP应用质量。'\n- name: RULER synthetic long-context evaluation\n  plan_id: plan_012\n  description: 'RULER (4K, 16K) × 3 task types: NIAH-Single, NIAH-MultiKey, Variable\n    Tracking。 Fine-grained capability diagnostics。'\n  expected_results:\n    dense_niah_s_4k: 98.0\n    dense_niah_s_16k: 92.0\n    dense_niah_mk_4k: 85.0\n    dense_niah_mk_16k: 70.0\n    dense_vt_4k: 80.0\n    dense_vt_16k: 62.0\n    kl_niah_s_4k: 88.0\n    kl_niah_s_16k: 70.0\n    kl_niah_mk_4k: 71.0\n    kl_niah_mk_16k: 45.0\n    kl_vt_4k: 64.0\n    kl_vt_16k: 35.0\n    bce_comp_niah_s_4k: 91.0\n    bce_comp_niah_s_16k: 76.0\n    bce_comp_niah_mk_4k: 75.0\n    bce_comp_niah_mk_16k: 52.0\n    bce_comp_vt_4k: 68.0\n    bce_comp_vt_16k: 42.0\n    kl_16k_avg_drop_vs_dense: 31.3\n    bce_comp_16k_avg_drop_vs_dense: 23.5\n  result_rationale: 'RULER的synthetic tasks提供了controlled capability measurement。 16K\n    context下KL-only降幅最大——NIAH-MultiKey从85→45（-47.1%）， Variable Tracking从62→35（-43.5%）。\n    这些任务需要精确的long-range retrieval和state tracking， sparse noise在16K tokens范围内严重干扰attention\n    pattern。\n\n    BCE+comp在所有6个setting上优于KL-only， 16K的NIAH-MultiKey差距7 points（52 vs 45），VT差距7 points（42\n    vs 35）。 Compensation的per-layer correction在长序列下提供了持续的error mitigation。\n\n    KL在4K→16K的degradation slope比BCE+comp更陡， 说明KL predictor的mask decision在序列长度增加时快速恶化——\n    进一步支持\"KL的训练信号不够robust\"的worst-tier叙事。'\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Table 12: RULER results (accuracy %)'\n    rows:\n    - Task | Context | Dense | KL-only | BCE+comp | Δ(KL vs BCE+comp)\n    - NIAH-S | 4K | 98.0 | 88.0 | 91.0 | -3.0\n    - NIAH-S | 16K | 92.0 | 70.0 | 76.0 | -6.0\n    - NIAH-MK | 4K | 85.0 | 71.0 | 75.0 | -4.0\n    - NIAH-MK | 16K | 70.0 | 45.0 | 52.0 | -7.0\n    - VT | 4K | 80.0 | 64.0 | 68.0 | -4.0\n    - VT | 16K | 62.0 | 35.0 | 42.0 | -7.0\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 12: Heatmap (method × task-context)。颜色深浅表示accuracy。KL-only在16K列明显偏暗，BCE+comp介于Dense和KL之间。'\n  analysis: RULER的controlled diagnostics是worst tier的fine-grained evidence。 KL-only在长序列上的capability\n    loss pattern清晰且一致， 作为EMNLP paper的补充diagnostics有说服力。 但RULER本身是P2 priority——如果时间不足，\n    LongBench (plan_010)已经cover了long-context方向， RULER提供的是complementary validation而非必要条件。\n","numLines":615,"startLine":1,"totalLines":615}}}
