{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_011vte1yvMH8i4SLga2Su4Y5","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_14/projects/distill_sparse_swiglu/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# distill_sparse_swiglu — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-15 16:53 UTC | 更新原因: Reviewer warning 修正：BCE std 0.72→0.89，Claim 3 降级，SPON 预算提升，并行启动计划\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\nKL-divergence 输出分布蒸馏训练 SwiGLU 激活稀疏性预测器，验证是否消除对 error compensation network 的需求，并测试与 SPON 静态校正的组合加性。详见 paper_framing.md。\\\\n\\\\n## 当前进展\\\\n- **阶段**: Research（MVP 2026-05-15 通过，D007）\\\\n- **MVP 结论**: KL sparse PPL 12.52 ± 0.92 vs BCE 44.05 ± 0.89 @ 50% sparsity，差距 31.53 PPL\\\\n- **关键发现**: KL 非均匀 per-layer 分配（0.22-0.80）vs BCE 均匀（0.43-0.66）；KL hard-mask PPL 9.20 接近 dense 6.12\\\\n- **Dream**: dream_20260515T164925 运行中（full review），等结果后批准 P0 实验\\\\n- **Experiment Plan**: 12 experiments（P0×7, P1×3, P2×2），总 196 GPU-hours。详见 experiment_plan.yaml\\\\n- **Reviewer Warning**: Claim 1 强度取决于 BCE+comp（未测）；Claim 3 降级为 testable prediction；SPON 复现是关键路径\\\\n\\\\n## 近期任务\\\\n- [x] MVP 验证（KL vs BCE @ 50% sparsity, 3 seeds）\\\\n- [x] 写 paper_framing.md + experiment_plan.yaml\\\\n- [x] 启动 Dream full review (dream_20260515T164925)\\\\n- [ ] 等 Dream 结果 → 按行动指令调整\\\\n- [ ] Dream 通过后并行启动: plan_001 BCE+comp (cuda:0) + plan_004 SPON (cuda:1)\\\\n- [ ] Agent 完成 vanilla TEAL baseline（队列中）\\\\n- [ ] 补 KL-only 2 seeds (s0, s1) → 5-seed headline\\\\n- [ ] 实现 BCE+compensation 训练流程\\\\n- [ ] 关注 s456 seed 敏感性（13.58 vs 12.08/11.91）\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 预算\\\\n- 本地: westd-34887 cuda:0, cuda:1 — RTX PRO 6000 Blackwell (98GB each)\\\\n- 可用: 444 GPU-hours remaining (480 - 36 MVP)\\\\n- 计划: P0 114h + P1 70h + P2 12h = 196h（44% 利用率）\\\\n- Constraint: C001 — 仅 cuda:0, cuda:1\\\\n\\\\n## 目标时间线\\\\n| 阶段 | 日期 | 内容 |\\\\n|------|------|------|\\\\n| Dream review | 05-15 | dream_20260515T164925 |\\\\n| Phase 1 | 05-15 ~ 05-18 | plan_001 BCE+comp + plan_004 SPON + plan_006 baselines（并行） |\\\\n| Phase 2 | 05-18 ~ 05-20 | plan_005 composition + plan_002 STE + plan_003 iso-compute |\\\\n| Phase 3 | 05-20 ~ 05-22 | plan_007 full eval + plan_008 sweep + plan_009 Mistral |\\\\n| Paper | 05-22 ~ 05-24 | Paper Agent Full Draft + iteration |\\\\n| Submit | 05-25 | ARR submission |\\\\n\\\\n## 关键决策日志\\\\n\\\\n| ID | 日期 | 摘要 | 关联实验 |\\\\n|----|------|------|----------|\\\\n| D007 | 2026-05-15 | MVP PASS: 项目进入 research 阶段，启动 post-MVP kickoff 流程 | mvp_kl_norm_v2_s42, mvp_kl_norm_v2_s123, mvp_kl_norm_v2_s456, mvp_bce_s42, mvp_bce_s123, mvp_bce_s456 |\\\\n| D006 | 2026-05-15 | 紧急停止 KL 训练：Reviewer 发现 ÷vocab_size 归一化 bug，kl_norm | kl_normalized_quicktest, mvp_kl_norm_s42, mvp_kl_norm_s123 |\\\\n| D005 | 2026-05-15 | KL 归一化确认 seq_len-only，启动 KL 3-seed 完整训练 | kl_normalized_quicktest, mvp_kl_s42, mvp_kl_s123, mvp_kl_s456 |\\\\n| D004 | 2026-05-15 | KL 稀疏性坍塌修复：选方案 C（KL loss 归一化 + 激进 Lagrangian），保持纯  | kl_lagrangian_quicktest |\\\\n| D003 | 2026-05-15 | KL 训练稀疏性坍塌至 0%，改用 Lagrangian multiplier 替代固定 reg_w | mvp_kl_s42 |\\\\n| D002 | 2026-05-15 | 校准数据从 SlimPajama-627B 改为 WikiText-103 train split | mvp_kl_s42, mvp_bce_s42 |\\\\n| D001 | 2026-05-15 | MVP 设计: KL vs BCE predictor 在 50% sparsity 下的 perp | — |\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 2753, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Qq8PZA9Uwspf57gCTio1Lb","session_id":"ea246f80-3204-4c6f-a88a-431a28811afc","uuid":"501e4ff5-0e81-4052-8954-51d49dfea4a4","timestamp":"2026-05-15T17:53:14.604Z"}
