{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01JYrUMoYp2hri6u1LkPA6DA","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_14/projects/distill_sparse_swiglu/memory.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Memory — distill_sparse_swiglu\\\\n\\\\n## 决策记录\\\\n\\\\n- [2026-05-15] s0/s1 完成后 GPU 分配：cuda:0 → bce_comp_staged_s42 (plan_001), cuda:1 → spon_training (plan_004)。Director 要求秒级衔接。\\\\n- [2026-05-15] WINA global 预期会崩（跨层归一化问题），不排查。正式 baseline: TEAL greedy + WINA greedy。WINA global 仅作 \\\\\\\"why greedy allocation matters\\\\\\\" motivation example。\\\\n- [2026-05-15] BCE+comp 代码通过 Reviewer：compensation 67.2M params (bottleneck=256)。losses.py / predictor.py / spon.py 全 PASS。\\\\n- [2026-05-15] SPON 458K params (bias vectors)，dry-run 通过。\\\\n- [2026-05-15] MVP 结论：KL sparse PPL 12.52 ± 0.92 vs BCE 44.05 ± 0.89 @ 50% sparsity。KL 非均匀 per-layer 分配 (0.22-0.80)。\\\\n- [2026-05-15] s456 seed 敏感性：sparse PPL 13.58 vs s42 12.08 / s123 11.91，PPL increase 48.6% vs 31.2%/28.8%。需关注。\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 729, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Qq8PZA9Uwspf57gCTio1Lb","session_id":"ea246f80-3204-4c6f-a88a-431a28811afc","uuid":"6ad3b83d-7470-4611-a3f1-4bcd95be1888","timestamp":"2026-05-15T17:53:15.045Z"}
